sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 User (Browser)
    participant FE as 🌐 Angular Frontend
    participant API as 🔐 ASP.NET Core API
    participant JWT as 🎫 JWT Service
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as ⚡ Redis
    participant MinIO as 📦 MinIO

    Note over U,MinIO: === Authentication Flow ===

    U->>FE: Enter credentials
    FE->>API: POST /api/account/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: Query user by email
    DB-->>API: User record
    API->>JWT: Generate JWT + Refresh Token
    JWT-->>API: Tokens
    API-->>FE: 200 OK {accessToken, refreshToken}
    FE->>FE: Store tokens in localStorage
    FE->>FE: Set Authorization header

    Note over U,MinIO: === Authenticated API Request ===

    U->>FE: Browse games
    FE->>API: GET /api/app/game [Authorization: Bearer jwt]
    API->>API: Validate JWT signature
    API->>API: Check Claims (UserId, Roles, Tenant)
    API->>Cache: Check Redis cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>API: Cached response
    else Cache Miss
        API->>DB: Query games with EF Core
        DB-->>API: Game entities
        API->>Cache: Store in Redis (TTL)
    end
    API-->>FE: 200 OK {items, totalCount}
    FE-->>U: Display game catalog

    Note over U,MinIO: === Game Upload (Developer) ===

    U->>FE: Upload game build (.zip)
    FE->>API: POST /api/developer/build {file}
    API->>API: Validate permissions (GameDeveloper)
    API->>MinIO: PutObject (game-builds bucket)
    MinIO-->>API: Object key
    API->>DB: Save Build entity
    DB-->>API: Build record
    API-->>FE: 201 Created {buildId}

    Note over U,MinIO: === Game Execution (Player) ===

    U->>FE: Click "Play" on game
    FE->>API: GET /api/app/game/{id}/play-url
    API->>Cache: Get signed URL (cached)
    alt URL Valid
        Cache-->>API: Signed MinIO URL
    else URL Expired
        API->>MinIO: Generate presigned URL
        MinIO-->>API: Signed URL (1h TTL)
        API->>Cache: Cache signed URL
    end
    API-->>FE: 200 OK {playUrl}
    FE->>FE: Load game in iframe
    FE->>FE: Initialize GameplayBridge (postMessage)
